WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hello! Welcome to Planeta Zero,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
the space that will help you change the world.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Here you will discover more sustainable habits and find solutions

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
to increase energy efficiency and reduce your carbon footprint.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
While avoiding CO₂ emissions into the atmosphere,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
step into a world of green perks, where you can:

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
take part in prize draws to win prizes, support socio-environmental projects

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
by voting on the initiatives that will receive financial support from EDP,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
enjoy discounts at EDP or with our partners

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
and get access to unique experiences.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
How do you get all this?

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
By making the world a better place and earning Zs.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
What are Zs?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Zs are the reward you receive whenever you help change the planet's future.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
But we'll explain it better.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Discover all the ways to earn.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
When you complete your profile information, you earn Zs.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
You also get personalised energy efficiency tips.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Tell us how you live, how many people live with you,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
the appliances you have at home, or whether you drive an electric car.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Only then can we give you accurate tips and, of course, plenty of Zs.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
You also earn when you change your energy consumption and improve your efficiency,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
when you receive our sustainable tips and when you complete the challenges we have for you.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:22.000
From small individual challenges to big global ones.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.500
But there's more.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.000
Inside Planeta Zero, there are four levels.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.000
You start as an Explorer and can rise to Ambassador.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.000
The greater your progress, the greater the benefits you receive,

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.000
and the greater your contribution to changing the world.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Today, the change begins.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.500
Welcome to Generation Zero.
